## Core recruiting platform

- [Applicant Tracking System](https://www.ashbyhq.com/platform/recruiting/ats): Configurable jobs and interview plans, pipeline visibility, workflow automation, offers, permissions, candidate data controls, and quality-of-hire workflows.
- [Sourcing and Recruiting CRM](https://www.ashbyhq.com/platform/recruiting/sourcing-crm): Talent pools, Chrome sourcing extension, multichannel sequences, candidate search, outreach analytics, and AI-assisted sourcing.
